179
00:08:55.935 --> 00:08:59.338
Now when we run this,
we'll get user post with extras.

180
00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.673
User mood is awful.

181
00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:01.874
Sentiment is negative.

182
00:09:01.874 --> 00:09:04.343
Can't believe how buggy the app is, etc.

183
00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:07.079
And then the user just says it's
very frustrated

184
00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:08.614
with the latest version of your app.

185
00:09:08.614 --> 00:09:12.818
And then of course we can pass this back
into our social media analyzer

186
00:09:13.119 --> 00:09:17.823
and see what it says. And as we can see
here, the social media analysis

187
00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:20.826
bot detects that it's about the app,
that the sentiment is negative.

188
00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.096
Provides an example response
